00:25:58.539 --> 00:26:00.539
I was a skeptic, too.

00:26:00.539 --> 00:26:07.539
On Krypton, our children are raised to revere the Red Sangod Rao.

00:26:07.539 --> 00:26:13.539
Unlike your civilizations, the superstition has no place in our beliefs.

00:26:13.539 --> 00:26:18.500
Religion is science.

00:26:18.500 --> 00:26:22.500
Not some mystical questioning of it.

00:26:22.500 --> 00:26:30.750
Your father left our Bible, the book of Rao on this earth.

00:26:30.750 --> 00:26:33.750
All of this and the knowledge in that book,

00:26:33.750 --> 00:26:34.750
come out.

00:26:34.750 --> 00:26:38.750
There is no limits to what we can achieve.

00:26:38.750 --> 00:26:54.829
I lost the GPS feed.

00:26:54.829 --> 00:26:58.039
Where'd you send him?

00:26:58.039 --> 00:27:02.269
On a hunch?

00:27:02.269 --> 00:27:19.309
Tess.

00:27:19.309 --> 00:27:22.309
How not surprised am I to see you here?

00:27:22.309 --> 00:27:25.309
By the way, this is the least secret, secret lab?

00:27:25.309 --> 00:27:27.309
I've ever been in.

00:27:27.309 --> 00:27:28.309
Twice.

00:27:28.309 --> 00:27:30.309
I am so sorry.

00:27:30.309 --> 00:27:33.309
I am so sorry to disappoint you, Lois,

00:27:33.309 --> 00:27:35.309
but I doubt that the government is going to want

00:27:35.309 --> 00:27:38.309
their covert defense programs on the front page of the Daily Planet,

00:27:38.309 --> 00:27:40.309
so if you could just...

00:27:40.309 --> 00:27:41.309
Shh.

00:27:41.309 --> 00:27:43.309
I saw what you did to Corbin.

00:27:43.309 --> 00:27:47.309
I was on the bus when you sent me on a trank trip to Mount Rushmore.

00:27:47.309 --> 00:27:49.309
You can't cover this up.

00:27:49.309 --> 00:27:50.309
Oh, whoa!

00:27:50.309 --> 00:27:56.299
Oh!

00:27:56.299 --> 00:28:02.680
Sorry, Lowe.

00:28:02.680 --> 00:28:04.680
You take care of her,

00:28:04.680 --> 00:28:07.680
and I'll clean the rest of this up to make sure that no one will believe

00:28:07.680 --> 00:28:19.539
Lois' trip down the rabbit hole.

00:28:19.539 --> 00:28:20.539
How did he get in there?

00:28:20.539 --> 00:29:03.430
Do you like what you've done with the place?

00:29:03.430 --> 00:29:47.759
I've got to truly welcome.

00:29:47.759 --> 00:30:39.769
I'm going to save you.

00:30:39.769 --> 00:30:46.150
My lucky day to be saved.

00:30:46.150 --> 00:32:29.529
You take lessons in how to do that?

00:32:29.529 --> 00:32:31.529
Okay. Isn't the appropriate response?

00:32:31.529 --> 00:32:35.349
Thank God you're still alive.

00:32:35.349 --> 00:32:37.349
Too bad you're wearing clothes this time?

00:32:37.349 --> 00:32:39.349
Yes, that's it.

00:32:39.349 --> 00:32:40.349
The first part.

00:32:40.349 --> 00:32:48.019
So, how did you get away from Mercer?

00:32:48.019 --> 00:32:50.019
Uh...

00:32:50.019 --> 00:32:52.019
Involved a secret cave,

00:32:52.019 --> 00:32:54.019
action sequence out of the ice capades,

00:32:54.019 --> 00:33:02.519
and your best friend.

00:33:02.519 --> 00:33:04.519
Maybe this makes up for everything.

00:33:04.519 --> 00:33:16.309
Where'd you get that?

00:33:16.309 --> 00:33:19.309
A souvenir from my own little adventure.

00:33:19.309 --> 00:33:27.980
You know, the first time I saw you, I never thought that you'd end up being my hero.

00:33:27.980 --> 00:33:35.460
Of course, I was hoping to escape with a different heart.

00:33:35.460 --> 00:33:43.789
You know, Lois, you're the only one that's been honest and brave.

00:33:43.789 --> 00:33:48.789
Wow, that's a scary high pedestal of adjectives you just put me on.

00:33:48.789 --> 00:33:51.789
You're the only one that's given me a chance.

00:33:51.789 --> 00:33:56.539
I mean, I can't ever tell anyone else about you.

00:33:56.539 --> 00:33:58.539
anyone else about me.

00:33:59.789 --> 00:34:11.130
You're the only chance that I have of living an honest, honest life.

00:34:11.130 --> 00:34:20.480
If I were going to disappear again, I would want to disappear with you.

00:34:20.480 --> 00:34:24.659
Me, John.

00:34:24.659 --> 00:34:29.949
That means a lot.

00:34:29.949 --> 00:34:31.949
But I'm with someone else.

00:34:31.949 --> 00:34:35.949
He's a little on the squeaky side, so I probably won't pull back the curtain

00:34:35.949 --> 00:34:38.949
and reveal our wild and crazy ride.

00:34:38.949 --> 00:34:42.949
But he is it for me.

00:34:42.949 --> 00:35:06.710
For me.

00:35:06.710 --> 00:35:08.710
You have one of those words for now?

00:35:08.710 --> 00:35:16.820
Um, maybe if this were another lifetime.

00:35:16.820 --> 00:35:29.880
I really hope that your guy knows who you really are,

00:35:29.880 --> 00:36:14.579
because you are a real...

00:36:14.579 --> 00:36:16.579
You're not that naive, are you?

00:36:16.579 --> 00:36:24.349
If Kallan and I can work together, why wouldn't I try?

00:36:24.349 --> 00:36:27.349
Because he doesn't have your best interest at heart.

00:36:27.349 --> 00:36:30.349
But you and I...

00:36:31.349 --> 00:36:40.199
We have a commitment to each other.

00:36:40.199 --> 00:36:42.199
You're not backing out on me, are you?

00:36:42.199 --> 00:36:46.199
Well, I'm not the one that sent a modern-day metal Nero to attack you.

00:36:46.199 --> 00:37:07.110
Not today.

00:37:07.110 --> 00:37:10.110
You can't bet everything we've worked for,

00:37:10.110 --> 00:37:12.110
including the safety of your people,

00:37:12.110 --> 00:37:15.110
on someone who's so quick to switch allegiancees.

00:37:15.110 --> 00:37:18.110
I don't think you have any idea of the power that lies within Kowel.

00:37:18.110 --> 00:37:23.500
Well, I hope you're right.

00:37:23.500 --> 00:37:29.099
Because you're losing control of the Kandorians.

00:37:29.099 --> 00:37:40.150
I discovered a secret rebellion.

00:37:40.150 --> 00:37:53.340
A group of your people have turned to you.

00:37:53.340 --> 00:37:55.340
of your people have turned against you

00:37:55.340 --> 00:38:26.579
and are looking to a new leader, Clark.

00:38:26.579 --> 00:38:29.579
I didn't think it would be a good idea to get the handy man to repair this.

00:38:29.579 --> 00:38:34.690
If I had an apology on video, it would have saved me a lot of time this year.

00:38:34.690 --> 00:38:42.500
I'd say I did my fair share of trespassing as well.

00:38:42.500 --> 00:38:45.500
You mean the part where you were amassing the only weapons that can kill me?

00:38:45.500 --> 00:38:47.500
Yeah, that would be the part.

00:38:47.500 --> 00:38:53.280
Maybe you're the one seeing things clearly from the beginning.

00:38:53.280 --> 00:38:58.070
Something I didn't tell you about the future.

00:38:58.070 --> 00:39:00.070
But your kryptonite armory was the only thing that saved the world.

00:39:00.070 --> 00:39:06.300
the only thing that saved the world.

00:39:06.300 --> 00:39:09.300
And me teaming up with Zod, turning my back on you and Oliver,

00:39:09.300 --> 00:39:11.300
that wasn't all the red krypton.

00:39:11.300 --> 00:39:13.929
Curious?

00:39:13.929 --> 00:39:17.929
I think it was some sort of wish fulfillment thing for me.

00:39:17.929 --> 00:39:22.929
Clark, if you wanted to redecorate the place, all you had to do is ask.

00:39:22.929 --> 00:39:30.280
Just that seeing you and Lois together, you're like sisters.

00:39:30.280 --> 00:39:34.280
Two of you have an understanding of each other shorthand that I've never known.

00:39:34.280 --> 00:39:36.280
We're family.

00:39:36.280 --> 00:39:38.280
That's something I don't have much of anymore.

00:39:38.280 --> 00:39:43.440
And Zod and I, we're...

00:39:43.440 --> 00:39:46.440
God and I, we've been on different sides.

00:39:46.440 --> 00:39:50.619
We've raised in different worlds.

00:39:50.619 --> 00:39:57.230
Somehow, through the isolation and the burdens,

00:39:57.230 --> 00:40:00.230
losing our home, trying to manage in somebody else's,

00:40:00.230 --> 00:40:03.230
he understands things about me that nobody else can.

00:40:03.230 --> 00:40:28.889
Chloe, he's the closest single brother that I may ever know.

00:40:28.889 --> 00:40:34.670
Some of our brothers and sisters have defected.

00:40:34.670 --> 00:40:39.340
I'm afraid we've been betrayed, but we will prevail.

